OL,3,GNEWSA'Incredible relief' as court
OL,4,Arefuses serial rapist's sentence appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA violent serial rapist who challenged
OL,7,Fhis 16-year jail sentence for crimes
OL,8,Fagainst four women has had his appeal
OL,9,Frefused.
OL,11,FChristopher Malcolm, 37, raped,
OL,12,Fattacked and abused former partners -
OL,13,Fpreventing one from attending her own
OL,14,Ffather's funeral - at locations in
OL,15,FMoray and Lothian.
OL,17,FA court heard he subjected the first
OL,18,Fwoman to abuse when he was just 19 in
OL,19,F2008, and carried on "terrorising"
OL,20,Fothers until his arrest in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
