OL,3,GNEWSA'Incredible relief' as court
OL,4,Arefuses serial rapist's sentence appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne woman recently told BBC Scotland
OL,7,Fthat Malcolm left her permanently
OL,8,Finjured and disfigured when he stopped
OL,9,Fher from seeking medical treatment
OL,10,Fafter fracturing her wrist and breaking
OL,11,Fher foot.
